# Gitignored files to copy into each new worktree via `wt step copy-ignored`
# (wired up in .config/wt.toml). A file is copied only if it is BOTH gitignored
# AND matches a pattern here, so tracked files (.env.example, docker.env,
# terraform.tfvars) are never touched. Patterns match at any depth, so one list
# covers every app's env file: backend/.env, frontend/.env.
#
# Keep this to env files — dependencies (node_modules, .venv) are installed
# per-worktree by the hooks in .config/wt.toml, never copied (.venv holds
# absolute paths and can't be relocated).
.env
.env*.local
*.env
